		{
			dependencies: ["2300F1C2E3D40008"]
			description: [
				"gregtech's own &awetware board&r is a multilayer board plus life support -- a petri dish, growth medium, a pump, a sensor. it keeps something alive."
				""
				"&aargentware&r forks off the same multilayer board and adds the opposite: a &4tartaric gem&r to hold the occupant, &4demon will&r to run it, and a &4will gauge&r to watch it. no dish, no medium, no pump. will does not eat."
				""
				"printing wants &aargent foil&r, which is &5draconium&r foil run through the blood altar. draconium is fusion-only, so this is not a cheap board."
